# Escrowed application environment allowlist (NO VALUES — names only).
#
# Format per line: ENV_VAR_NAME OpenBao-entry-path OpenBao-field
# Backup marks matching redacted container env as escrow-recoverable
# (manifest env_escrowed) instead of operator-relayed; restore re-injects
# them from OpenBao without human relay. This file ships with the backup
# companions (non-secret) and is resolved relative to backup-app-workloads.sh.
#
# NOTE: the entry below is a fixture/example path used by the hermetic
# self-tests (no live secret entry required). Per-app entries are added
# here when a workload needs rebuild-surviving secrets.
STORAGE_ENCRYPTION_KEY secret/projects/nomad/APPSHARED STORAGE_ENCRYPTION_KEY
API_KEY_SECRET secret/projects/nomad/APPSHARED API_KEY_SECRET
JWT_SECRET secret/projects/nomad/APPSHARED JWT_SECRET
